{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"Creates or replaces one asset in data/<lib>/_ASSETS/. Pass small text assets inline via `content` (with tempfile empty); pass uploaded files as the temp-file path the platform's multipart POST handling provides via `tempfile`. Parent subdirectories are created as needed. Returns {name, size, replaced} - replaced is true when an existing asset was overwritten. Asset names are relative paths inside _ASSETS; traversal ('..', leading '/') is rejected.","import":"use flowlang::datastore::DataStore;\nuse ndata::dataobject::DataObject;\n","params":[{"desc":"Library name.","name":"lib","type":"String"},{"desc":"Relative path of the asset inside data/<lib>/_ASSETS/ with '/' separators (e.g. 'style.css', 'vendor/lib.js'). No leading '/', no '..'.","name":"name","type":"String"},{"desc":"The asset's content, inline. Used when tempfile is empty; suits text assets.","name":"content","type":"String"},{"desc":"Path to an uploaded temp file to copy into place (multipart POST parts land as temp-file paths in params). Empty means write `content` instead. When set, `content` is ignored.","name":"tempfile","type":"String"}],"returntype":"FLAT","type":"rust"},"id":"vxxmwl19f96bdd725r566f","readers":[],"time":1784940451621,"username":"system","writers":[]}